Z||000000||Eric||06-06-99||04:50 PM||||Does anybody know where I can find new weatherstriping?  I've got a lot of wind noise coming in through the sunroof and windows.  The Fiero Store has it, but the price is completly unreasonable.  I do have to get new dew strips for the outside of my window but the actual weatherstrip everywhere else is in good shape, just a little leaky.  Maybe there is some way to fix what I have.  Any ideas?  
Z||000001||RFMike||06-07-99||05:50 AM||||You're sure the windows don't need adjusting in or out?
Z||000002||Eric||06-07-99||09:01 AM||||They could need adjusting, but most of the noise is coming through the back of the sunroof.  How would you adjust that?
Z||000003||grizco||06-09-99||12:23 AM||||My 84 SE had a bad wind noise coming from the sun roof. When I took it out I found that the screw holding the right front tab in place had started to back out. I tightened it and it took care of the problem.
